---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const portraitSrc = `${base}/images/arne-portrait-platzhalter.jpg`;
---

<section id="about" class="about">
    <div class="about_inner">
       <div class="about_media">
            <img
                src={portraitSrc}
                alt="Arne Kellermann in seinem Tattoo-Studio"
                width="400"
                height="500"
                loading="lazy"
            />
        </div>

        <div class="about_text">
            <p class="about_eyebrow">- Über mich - </p>
            <h2 class="about_title">Custom Tattoos in entspannter Atmosphäre</h2>

            <p class="about_lead">
                Hi, ich bin Arne. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consetetur sadipscing elitr, sed diam nonumy eirmod.
            </p>
            <p>
                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consetetur sadipscing elitr, sed diam nonumy eirmod tempor invidunt ut labore et dolore magna aliquyam erat, 
                sed diam voluptua. At vero eos et accusam et justo duo dolores et ea rebum. Stet clita kasd gubergren.
            </p>
            <p>
                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consetetur sadipscing elitr, sed diam nonumy eirmod tempor invidunt ut 
                labore et dolore magna aliquyam erat, sed diam voluptua. At vero eos et accusam et
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about {
        padding-block: var(--space-3xl);
        scroll-margin-top: var(--header-height);
    }

    .about_inner {
        max-width: var(--container-max);
        margin-inline: auto;
        padding-inline: var(--space-md);

        display: grid;
        gap: var(--space-2xl);
        align-items: center;
    }

    .about_media img {
        height: auto;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 20rem;
        margin-inline: auto;
        aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    }

    .about_text {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: var(--space-md);
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
    }

    .about_eyebrow {
        font-size: var(--text-sm);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        color: var(--color-accent);
    }

    .about_title {
        font-size: var(--text-2xl);
        color: var(--color-text);
    }

    .about_lead {
        font-size: var(--text-lg);
        color: var(--color-text);
    }

    @media (min-width: 48rem) {
        .about_inner {
            grid-template-columns: 20rem 1fr;
        }
    }
</style>